  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Black Studies"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Black Studies Minor provides students with an interdisciplinary approach to exploring the histories and cultures of Black diasporas, ideologies of anti-Black racism, themes of Black resistance to oppression and exploitation, and the range of political strategies and community-based mobilization tactics Black activists and their allies have employed to counter systemic and institutionalized oppressions and fight for social justice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by : Department of English"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: Students may use a maximum of two (2) courses in any given discipline (indicated by the subject prefix of the course code) toward completion of the minor in Black Studies. Students may use a maximum of two (2) of HIS or HST courses towards completion of the minor. To enhance the cross-disciplinary range of the minor and to limit overlap with the Caribbean Studies minor, students are limited to only two (2) Caribbean Studies courses in the Black Studies minor; a maximum of two from the following: CRB 501 , ENG 620 , FRS 602 , GEO 705 , GMS 693 , HST 222 , SPS 502 . Please note, it is not possible for students to use the same course to count for more than ONE minor.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CRB 501",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/caribbean-studies/CRB/501/"
        },
        {
          "text": "ENG 620",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/english/ENG/620/"
        },
        {
          "text": "FRS 602",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/french-studies/FRS/602/"
        },
        {
          "text": "GEO 705",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/geography/GEO/705/"
        },
        {
          "text": "GMS 693",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/global-management-studies/GMS/693/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HST 222",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/history/HST/222/"
        },
        {
          "text": "SPS 502",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/spanish-studies/SPS/502/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses in total from the following:"
    },
